{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;In Doctor Dreams, you own a clinic, sell medicine, and can treat special patients by entering their dreams&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/cf19585a7ec53d0a25dd7a088e66f136.avif?t=1753831385\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/790c84ec1817b92cd0853e7c38328c6a.poster.avif?t=1753831385\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/790c84ec1817b92cd0853e7c38328c6a.webm?t=1753831385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/790c84ec1817b92cd0853e7c38328c6a.mp4?t=1753831385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create personalized medicine to deliver to your customers or patients. Combine unique ingredients, follow secret recipes, and experiment to discover new effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/69d4f2a33f182597f60523675eb61009.avif?t=1753831385\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/66c99319f0cf14396fbd4d36764f9adb.poster.avif?t=1753831385\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/66c99319f0cf14396fbd4d36764f9adb.webm?t=1753831385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/66c99319f0cf14396fbd4d36764f9adb.mp4?t=1753831385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scan prices, take orders, deliver them correctly, receive payment, and give change if needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/9118b0ad58572b4c3084fe2f793f1918.avif?t=1753831385\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/8d4fbce132a87c3758d4e5dc84cd388f.poster.avif?t=1753831385\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/8d4fbce132a87c3758d4e5dc84cd388f.webm?t=1753831385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/8d4fbce132a87c3758d4e5dc84cd388f.mp4?t=1753831385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Receive patients, clean rooms, hire staff, upgrade facilities, and earn reputation\u2026 or end up bankrupt due to malpractice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/359fbff5e109fe54ddc1203a0eedd1c2.avif?t=1753831385\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/9e9e89a339a3c42eb8506b6408ef4247.poster.avif?t=1753831385\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/9e9e89a339a3c42eb8506b6408ef4247.webm?t=1753831385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/9e9e89a339a3c42eb8506b6408ef4247.mp4?t=1753831385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Day sales not enough?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make the decision to sell your illegal medicine at night on the black market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But be careful: the police are watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/8f93131eaf82285e8c42f28cd883f7e1.avif?t=1753831385\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/1388c40dbc94ea9070714e9de50fb661.poster.avif?t=1753831385\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/1388c40dbc94ea9070714e9de50fb661.webm?t=1753831385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/1388c40dbc94ea9070714e9de50fb661.mp4?t=1753831385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore unique dreams divided into 5 chapters, each with completely different mechanics: from boss fights and puzzle solving to stealth sequences and psychological horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/196018a2e4722fc1d4a22f08c8ee6f98.avif?t=1753831385\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/321fa0a9bdb41fe3a18b2f5f19588ff7.poster.avif?t=1753831385\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/321fa0a9bdb41fe3a18b2f5f19588ff7.webm?t=1753831385\" ty